-- Stretch 5 Felwood (fel-*): the Emerald Sanctuary, Jaedenar, Bloodvenom Post, Timbermaw in the north.
-- Stretch 6 Winterspring (ws-*) through the Timbermaw tunnel: Donova Snowden, then Everlook.
-- Stretch 8 back to the Eastern Kingdoms (why: the Plaguelands quests fit 53-56): the Undercity hand-ins, the
--   Western Plaguelands from the Bulwark (wpl-*), the Eastern Plaguelands (epl-*).
-- Stretch 10 back to Kalimdor (why: Mount Hyjal and Silithus need level 54): Mount Hyjal (hyj-*, Forever's zone)
--   from Everlook, then Silithus (sil-*) from Cenarion Hold, where the route ends.
