-- (Feralas, Tanaris and Felwood again), A-Me 01 parts 2-3 (the casing drops outside Un'Goro in the data), the
-- Un'Goro apes and U'cha (Torwa is far from the gorillas), the east and west pylons, Greta's water chain (Barrens
-- trip), Wild Guardians (owlbeasts in Winterspring, hand-in in Felwood), the Winterfall cauldron chain (Felwood and
-- Winterspring back and forth), Are We There, Yeti? part 3 (three far towns), the Moonglade chain (Thunder Bluff
-- first), the Colossus letters to Booty Bay and Searing Gorge, cloth donations (need cloth stacks), raid, dungeon and
